WEBVTT

00:08:55.521 --> 00:09:00.084
And we have larger feet to stand
away from the kitchen sink.

00:09:00.084 --> 00:09:01.737
(Laughter)

00:09:01.737 --> 00:09:05.562
Let me share with you 
two secrets of success:

00:09:05.562 --> 00:09:11.781
Surround yourself with first-class people
and people that you like;

00:09:11.781 --> 00:09:18.065
and choose your partner
very, very carefully.

00:09:18.065 --> 00:09:21.278
Because the other day when I said, 
"My husband's an angel,"

00:09:21.278 --> 00:09:23.764
a woman complained --
"You're lucky," she said,

00:09:23.764 --> 00:09:25.790
"mine's still alive."

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.807
(Laughter)